  Description: You grew up in northern Brevoy, but the call for heroes willing to
    help take back your country's rightful holdings in the Stolen Lands has inflamed
    your dreams of profit and possibilities, and you have joined an expedition journeying
    south. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Society skill and
    the Legal Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Streetwise]
    skill feat.
